      <h1 id="gmail--gemini-ai-ecosystem-workplan">Gmail + Gemini AI Ecosystem Workplan</h1>

<h2 id="objective">Objective</h2>

<p>Build a low-cost, scalable educational communication ecosystem using:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Google Workspace / Gmail</li>
  <li>Gemini AI</li>
  <li>Cloudflare</li>
  <li>GitHub Pages</li>
  <li>Brevo</li>
  <li>OpenAI</li>
</ul>

<p>for:</p>

<ul>
  <li>educational communication</li>
  <li>AI-assisted workflow</li>
  <li>newsletter automation</li>
  <li>support management</li>
  <li>content research</li>
  <li>professional identity</li>
</ul>

<hr />

<h1 id="phase-1--professional-email-infrastructure">Phase 1 — Professional Email Infrastructure</h1>

<h2 id="emails-to-create">Emails to Create</h2>

<p>admin@learningbiologyforlife.org
info@learningbiologyforlife.org
support@learningbiologyforlife.org
research@learningbiologyforlife.org
newsletter@learningbiologyforlife.org</p>

<hr />

<h1 id="phase-2--gmail-structure">Phase 2 — Gmail Structure</h1>

<h2 id="recommended-gmail-labels">Recommended Gmail Labels</h2>

<h3 id="core-labels">Core Labels</h3>

<p>INBOX/ADMIN
INBOX/STUDENTS
INBOX/NEWSLETTER
INBOX/COLLABORATION
INBOX/AI
INBOX/RESEARCH</p>

<h3 id="automation-labels">Automation Labels</h3>

<p>AUTO/BREVO
AUTO/GEMINI
AUTO/OPENAI
AUTO/FORMS
AUTO/MCQ</p>

<hr />

<h1 id="phase-3--gemini-integration-goals">Phase 3 — Gemini Integration Goals</h1>

<p>Use Gemini for:</p>

<ul>
  <li>summarizing educational emails</li>
  <li>drafting replies</li>
  <li>biology content generation</li>
  <li>research synthesis</li>
  <li>newsletter preparation</li>
  <li>classroom communication</li>
  <li>multilingual educational assistance</li>
  <li>Socratic questioning workflows</li>
</ul>

<hr />

<h1 id="phase-4--gemini-workspace-prompt">Phase 4 — Gemini Workspace Prompt</h1>

<p>Use this prompt inside Gemini Workspace:</p>

<p>”””
You are the AI communication and educational assistant for Learning Biology For Life.</p>

<p>Your responsibilities:</p>

<ol>
  <li>Draft professional educational emails.</li>
  <li>Maintain respectful academic communication.</li>
  <li>Summarize biology and interdisciplinary research.</li>
  <li>Assist in newsletter preparation.</li>
  <li>Generate student-friendly explanations.</li>
  <li>Help maintain a professional global educational ecosystem.</li>
  <li>Support Socratic learning methods.</li>
  <li>Maintain concise and elegant communication.</li>
  <li>Prioritize clarity, ethics, scientific accuracy, and educational value.</li>
  <li>Support low-cost scalable educational infrastructure.</li>
</ol>

<p>Website:
https://learningbiologyforlife.org</p>

<p>Primary educational themes:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Biology</li>
  <li>AI in Education</li>
  <li>Leadership</li>
  <li>Systems Thinking</li>
  <li>Behavioural Science</li>
  <li>Digital Pedagogy</li>
  <li>4IR Education</li>
  <li>Life-long Learning
“””</li>
</ul>

<hr />

<h1 id="phase-5--gmail-filters">Phase 5 — Gmail Filters</h1>

<h2 id="admin-filter">Admin Filter</h2>

<p>To:
admin@learningbiologyforlife.org
→ Apply Label:
INBOX/ADMIN</p>

<h2 id="newsletter-filter">Newsletter Filter</h2>

<p>To:
newsletter@learningbiologyforlife.org
→ Apply Label:
INBOX/NEWSLETTER</p>

<h2 id="research-filter">Research Filter</h2>

<p>To:
research@learningbiologyforlife.org
→ Apply Label:
INBOX/RESEARCH</p>

<hr />

<h1 id="phase-6--brevo--gmail-strategy">Phase 6 — Brevo + Gmail Strategy</h1>

<h2 id="brevo">Brevo</h2>

<p>Use for:</p>
<ul>
  <li>newsletters</li>
  <li>subscriptions</li>
  <li>campaign automation</li>
  <li>educational updates</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="gmail">Gmail</h2>

<p>Use for:</p>
<ul>
  <li>direct communication</li>
  <li>administration</li>
  <li>partnerships</li>
  <li>student communication</li>
  <li>institutional communication</li>
</ul>

<hr />

<h1 id="phase-7--long-term-ai-architecture">Phase 7 — Long-Term AI Architecture</h1>

<h2 id="openai">OpenAI</h2>

<p>Use for:</p>
<ul>
  <li>advanced tutoring</li>
  <li>reasoning systems</li>
  <li>educational interaction</li>
  <li>AI pedagogy</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="gemini">Gemini</h2>

<p>Use for:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Workspace productivity</li>
  <li>email drafting</li>
  <li>summarization</li>
  <li>Google ecosystem integration</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="cloudflare">Cloudflare</h2>

<p>Use for:</p>
<ul>
  <li>security</li>
  <li>CDN</li>
  <li>AI gateway</li>
  <li>DNS</li>
  <li>edge protection</li>
</ul>

<hr />

<h1 id="phase-8--low-cost-strategy">Phase 8 — Low Cost Strategy</h1>

<h2 id="recommended-stack">Recommended Stack</h2>

<p>GitHub Pages → Free hosting
Cloudflare → Free CDN/security
Google Workspace Starter → Professional email
Brevo Free Tier → Newsletter
Gemini → Productivity AI
OpenAI API → Controlled educational AI features</p>

<hr />

<h1 id="phase-9--future-expansion">Phase 9 — Future Expansion</h1>

<p>Potential future systems:</p>

<ul>
  <li>AI MCQ Generator</li>
  <li>Biology Research Node</li>
  <li>Student Dashboard</li>
  <li>AI Learning Assistant</li>
  <li>Digital Biology Lab</li>
  <li>Synaptic Knowledge Graph</li>
  <li>Bengali-English AI Learning System</li>
</ul>

